OL,3,GNEWSATwo arrested on suspicion of
OL,4,Amurder after man shot
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo people have been arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of murder after a man's body
OL,8,Fwas found with gunshot wounds in
OL,9,Fwoodlands in Sheffield, according to
OL,10,Fpolice.
OL,12,FThe man, who is yet to be identified,
OL,13,Fwas found in Ecclesall Woods by a
OL,14,Fmember of the public at about 18:46 BST
OL,15,Fon Wednesday.
OL,17,FSouth Yorkshire Police said a
OL,18,Fpost-mortem examination revealed he
OL,19,Fdied as a result of a gunshot wound.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
